The '''Klosslands''' was an area of [[jungle]] on the [[moon]] [[Ajan Kloss]]. During the [[First Order-Resistance War|war]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]], a vast [[cave]] within the Klosslands was occupied by [[Resistance base (Ajan Kloss)|the Resistance's main operational base]].<ref name="TROS VD" />

